On all supported platforms this software uses the header-only library:
** cxxopts:
   - MIT License
   - source code: https://github.com/jarro2783/cxxopts
   - LICENSE and README files: "cxxopts" directory

On Windows this software uses the following third party libraries
with static linkage:

** lame 3.100:
   - LGPL v2 license (GNU Library General Public License, version 2)
   - source code: http://lame.sourceforge.net/
   - LICENSE, COPYING (full license text) and README files: "lame-3.100" directory

** pthread:
   - PTHREADS4W (a.k.a. PTHREADS-WIN32)
     (Open Source Software implementation of the Threads
     component of the POSIX 1003.1c 1995 Standard)
   - Apache License 2.0
   - source code: https://sourceforge.net/projects/pthreads4w/
   - LICENSE and README files: "pthreads" directory

On Linux this software links dynamically against the following libraries
installed from the packages of the Linux distribution:

** lame 3.100:
   - LGPL v2 license (GNU Library General Public License, version 2)
   - full license text: "lame-3.100/COPYING"

** GNU C Library (glibc), including the pthreads implementation NPTL:
   - LGPL v2.1 or later

Test files:

